      "nextSteps": [
        {
          "text": "You should note that whilst the transactions are pending, there could be movements within the stock-market; that is to say that the stock-market could rise or fall in value. If the market rises in value between the date of realising your existing funds and the purchase of your new (funds), you could be financially disadvantaged insofar as the cost of buying your new fund could be greater. Conversely, if there is a fall in the market between the date of realising your existing funds and the purchase of your new funds, you could be financially advantaged insofar as the cost of buying your new funds could be lower.",
          "topic": "OutOfMarketRisk",
          "isClientSpecific": false,
          "provenance": {
            "assertionStatus": "Stated",
            "modality": "Actual",
            "documentId": "Suitability report 2026.pdf",
            "documentCategory": "H_SolutionDesign",
            "pageNumbers": [
              11
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Should you require access to these funds in the future it will usually take 10-15 working days for administration, disinvestment and banking processes to complete. You are comfortable with the concept as you have liquid cash should you require instance access funds.",
          "topic": "AccessTimescale",
          "isClientSpecific": true,
          "provenance": {
            "assertionStatus": "Stated",
            "modality": "Reported",
            "documentId": "Suitability report 2026.pdf",
            "documentCategory": "H_SolutionDesign",
            "pageNumbers": [
              11
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "There is no guarantee the return on the new investment will be greater than that of your existing arrangement for these funds.",
          "topic": "NoGuaranteeOfOutperformance",
          "isClientSpecific": false,
          "provenance": {
            "assertionStatus": "Stated",
            "modality": "Actual",
            "documentId": "Suitability report 2026.pdf",
